function nlParse(raw){return EN?nlParseEn(raw):ARB?nlParseAr(raw):nlParseFa(raw)}
/* ---------- quick add (Arabic): "غداً الساعة ٥ مساءً اجتماع مع علي #عمل !عاجل كل أسبوع" ----------
   Text is first normalised (diacritics and tatweel removed, أإآ -> ا, ى -> ي, ة -> ه, all digits -> 0-9), then dates, times,
   priority, repetition and tags are cut out; what is left is the title. Dates are Gregorian (day + month name or d/m[/y]). */
